///! runtime/core — base tier of the Cryo runtime.
///!
///! Built freestanding (`no_runtime` + `no_std`) into libcryort-core.a. This
///! root currently carries the freestanding program entry; the lang-item
///! declarations (the `__cryo_panic` funnel and check handlers, see
///! `../../abi/lang_items.def`) arrive alongside their compiler-emitted call
///! sites in later tiers.

namespace CryoRt::Core;

/// The freestanding program entry (`_start`, `__cryo_start`). Present only in
/// `no_runtime` builds.
public module entry;
